{"ts": 1791257841.612283, "type": "step", "step": 10, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "Proxy vs direct measures"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257843.159708, "type": "step", "step": 11, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re looking for the distinction between the two evaluation styles:\n\n- **pass@k** = at least one of k tries succeeds\n- **pass^k** = all k tries succeed\n\nFor the build, the point is usually to argue about **reliability**. So if your system needs to work every time when deployed, pass^k is the stricter and more relevant measure. pass@k is more like \u201ccan it succeed sometimes if we try enough times?\u201d\n\nA simple way to write the eval section:\n1. Say what you measured.\n2. Say why that metric matches the goal.\n3. Mention any proxy/direct measure tradeoff.\n\nIf you want, send me your draft eval paragraph and I\u2019ll help tighten it up.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.35535796159308425}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257844.477222, "type": "step", "step": 12, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Got it \u2014 if you\u2019re still stuck, paste the exact eval section you\u2019ve written so far and I\u2019ll edit it with you. If you haven\u2019t written it yet, here\u2019s a fill-in template:\n\n\u201cOverall, we evaluate our system using ____. This metric is appropriate because our goal is ____. We also note the difference between a proxy measure and the direct outcome we care about: ____ is a proxy, while ____ is the more direct measure of success.\u201d\n\nIf you send me 2\u20133 sentences from your draft, I\u2019ll turn them into a clean final version.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: sure\n[activity] t=4 messages 2m", "t": 6, "activity": [{"t": 4, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.35535796159308425}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
